# Local per-dev override config (F-01). appsettings.json stays TRACKED but
# secret-free (DefaultConnection = ""); the real DB password lives ONLY in
# user-secrets (dev) or the ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection env var (prod).
# Only the local override file is ignored; its .example template stays tracked.
**/appsettings.Development.json
!**/appsettings.Development.example.json
